ent eligibility and current facility access.","short_summary":"A large recreation facility with fitness, aquatics, courts, and climbing.","evidence_claim":"UCF’s campus tour identifies the Recreation and Wellness Center as a 150,000-square-foot facility with pools, fitness areas, a climbing tower, and courts.","source_url":"https://www.ucf.edu/admissions/undergraduate/get-to-know-ucfs-campus/","source_title":"Get to Know UCF’s Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility use is subject to current Recreation and Wellness Center eligibility, policies, and operating hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ucf-challenge-course","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"UCF Challenge Course","title":"Plan a future Challenge Course session","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · near the Barbara Ying Center","notes":"If you have a group to bring together, review the low-element options and reservation process instead of arriving expecting a walk-in activity.","short_summary":"A reservation-based adventure-learning program for team building.","evidence_claim":"UCF states that its Challenge Course supports team building, self-confidence, and leadership through adventure-based learning and is open by reservation or special event only.","source_url":"https://rwc.sswb.ucf.edu/programs/outdoor-adventure/challenge-course/","source_title":"Challenge Course — UCF Recreation and Wellness Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservation or special event required; program prices vary. Wear required athletic attire and closed-toe shoes when participating.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ucf-john-c-hitt-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"John